  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Samim Ahmed S/O Abdul Vahid vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 12 June, 2024 Author: Shivkumar Dige Bench: Shivkumar Dige 2024:Bhc-Aug:10747 1 220.24Aba In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 939 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 220 Of 2024 Samim Ahmed s/o. Abdul Vahid. .. Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra & another. .. Respondents ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr.Saurabh R. Nikat h/f. Adv.R.R.Karpe App for Respondent-State : Mr.P.K.Lakhotiya ... Coram : Shivkumar Dige, J.",
    "facts": "At that time, the applicant ran away by taking advantage of darkness. In all 45 Gani bags containing Goa 1000 Gutkha worth Rs.18,00,000/- was found. It was seized and taken in custody.",
    "arguments": "Therefore, custodial interrogation of the applicant is not required."
  },
